NDC — Nested Data Compute

This suite is a benchmark derived from the TPC Benchmark TPC-H and as
such is not comparable to published TPC-H results, as the ndc-tpch
results do not comply with the TPC-H Specification.

NDC also draws conceptual inspiration from TPC-DS qualification, analytical
query patterns, data maintenance, and throughput phases. It does not implement
the full TPC-DS schema or workload and is not compliant with the TPC-DS
Specification. NDC results are not comparable to published TPC-DS results.
No TPC-DS generator or query-template source is redistributed here.
TPC-H and TPC-DS are trademarks of the Transaction Processing Performance Council.

TPC-H, dbgen, and qgen are Copyright © Transaction Processing Performance
Council (TPC). The TPC benchmark specifications and the dbgen/qgen tools
are used here under the TPC Fair Use policies (Fair Use of TPC
Specifications, Policies 8.3; Fair Use Quick Reference v1.0.0). No dbgen
or qgen source is redistributed by this repository: data is generated
locally via the DuckDB `tpch` extension (MIT licensed) calling dbgen.

All deviations from the TPC-H Specification (schema layout, query text,
data layout, run methodology, metrics) are declared in the repository
documentation and schema-v2 result records. Legacy records lack some required disclosure.

